    "What you already have on this device stays as it is. If something differs, you're asked about it after you tap Import." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you already have on this device stays as it is. If something differs, you're asked about it after you tap Import."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det du redan har på den här enheten förblir som det är. Skiljer sig något får du frågan när du har tryckt på Läs in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you already have on this device stays as it is; if something differs, you're asked about it. Your other device waits up to 5 minutes. If it stops waiting, nothing is brought here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you already have on this device stays as it is; if something differs, you're asked about it. Your other device waits up to 5 minutes. If it stops waiting, nothing is brought here."
