    "Saving to iPhone puts a copy of this account's contacts in the Contacts app, so calls show who is calling. Turning it off removes that copy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saving to iPhone puts a copy of this account's contacts in the Contacts app, so calls show who is calling. Turning it off removes that copy."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Att spara på iPhone lägger en kopia av kontots kontakter i appen Kontakter, så att du ser vem som ringer. Slår du av det tas kopian bort."
          }
        }
